    "description": "Two fourteen-year-olds come together sharing misery and pain. Ignored and disliked by their respective parents and coming from troubled homes where they are ignored at best and invited to commit suicide at worst. In the aftermath of an earthquake the class-mates learn how to survive while relying on one another for emotional and physical support.",
